{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45005","headline":"奉酬李中丞洪湖州西亭即事见寄兼呈吴冯处士时中丞量移湖州长史 · 皎然","name":"奉酬李中丞洪湖州西亭即事见寄兼呈吴冯处士时中丞量移湖州长史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱君溪上住，迟月开前扃。\n山火照书卷，野风吹酒瓶。\n爲谁留此物，意在眼中青。\n樵子逗烟墅，渔翁宿沙汀。\n主人非楚客，莫谩讥独醒。\n宿昔邢城功，道高心已冥。\n贪将到处士，放醉乌家亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}